1
00:00:23,808 --> 00:00:28,547
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,547 --> 00:00:32,259
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,483 --> 00:00:34,728
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,075 --> 00:00:37,782
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,661 --> 00:00:43,189
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,189 --> 00:00:46,821
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,299 --> 00:00:50,787
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,931 --> 00:00:55,427
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,427 --> 00:01:00,067
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,455 --> 00:01:02,115
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,115 --> 00:01:08,067
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,259 --> 00:01:11,947
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,947 --> 00:01:15,518
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,683 --> 00:01:22,627
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,075 --> 00:01:26,696
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,696 --> 00:01:30,380
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,467 --> 00:01:35,395
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,395 --> 00:01:39,555
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,328 --> 00:01:46,851
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,488 --> 00:01:50,051
=Episode 11=

21
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,319
I'm sorry.

22
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:36,039
If you didn't want to go with me,
you could have told me.

23
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:40,199
Why did you lie to me,
saying you wanted to elope with me?

24
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:44,599
Was I just a pawn
in your path of revenge,

25
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:47,280
merely to satisfy your selfish desires?

26
00:02:56,319 --> 00:02:57,360
Miss Jiang said

27
00:02:57,599 --> 00:02:59,639
that Rong Xiaonan treated her as a wife.

28
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:05,479
She also mentioned Rong Xiaonan's
selfish revenge or selfish desires.

29
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:06,960
What she said was "pawn".

30
00:03:07,319 --> 00:03:08,159
A pawn.

31
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:08,879
That's right.

32
00:03:08,879 --> 00:03:09,952
A pawn.

33
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,319
You can hate me.

34
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:23,759
No matter what, I'll clear your name.
That's what I owe you.

35
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:24,919
I don't need that.

36
00:03:27,319 --> 00:03:31,159
If it weren't for you,
my father would still be alive,

37
00:03:32,319 --> 00:03:35,960
and no one would be pointing fingers
at me, calling me a father-killer.

38
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:38,639
Rong Xiaonan,

39
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,840
wasn't I good to you?

40
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:45,199
Why did you harm me like this?

41
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,400
Miss Jiang,

42
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:56,280
I've never had the slightest intention
of causing you harm.

43
00:03:58,016 --> 00:04:00,520
I bore the weight of the dozen lives
of the Rongqing Troupe.

44
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:03,120
I had no choice.

45
00:04:13,039 --> 00:04:15,080
Rong Xiaonan has kept apologizing,

46
00:04:15,199 --> 00:04:17,079
and Miss Jiang has kept being angry.

47
00:04:18,319 --> 00:04:19,680
I'll keep eavesdropping for you.

48
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:20,959
Come back.

49
00:04:23,319 --> 00:04:24,519
Who told you to eavesdrop?

50
00:04:25,319 --> 00:04:28,040
I don't care at all what they say.

51
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:31,199
Now, do you think
your revenge has succeeded?

52
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:36,639
I'm telling you, Xu Fan is still alive.

53
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:40,920
He's safely recovering
at the Governor Mansion now.

54
00:04:41,399 --> 00:04:43,800
The only one who died
in this farce is my father.

55
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:48,560
Your revenge is nothing but a joke.

56
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:17,568
(It's still warm. He was just here.)

57
00:05:35,959 --> 00:05:38,040
The all-mighty, great governor

58
00:05:38,959 --> 00:05:41,000
has fallen to such a state?

59
00:05:41,472 --> 00:05:42,368
I beg you.

60
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:46,839
Letting you die now
would be letting you off too easy.

61
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:52,120
I should let you
be tormented day and night

62
00:05:56,192 --> 00:05:57,959
by the wronged souls you killed.

63
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:24,959
Were you afraid I'd kill him,
so you waited here for me?

64
00:06:26,759 --> 00:06:29,560
Looking at him now,
isn't he as good as the dead?

65
00:06:31,079 --> 00:06:34,600
I promised to care for him
until his death.

66
00:06:36,319 --> 00:06:37,760
Sparing his life now

67
00:06:42,496 --> 00:06:44,360
will be my repayment for raising me.

68
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,279
You're benevolent to him, Governor Xu.

69
00:06:48,199 --> 00:06:52,240
I didn't expect that you would
also keep your words at times.

70
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:57,360
After all, you still owe me
one unfulfilled promise.

71
00:06:57,759 --> 00:07:01,439
I never owe anyone.

72
00:07:06,199 --> 00:07:07,000
Governor,

73
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:08,928
the car to the Jiang residence is ready.

74
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:13,000
The top priority now
is to clear Miss Jiang's name.

75
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:40,680
Once I take back the Governor Mansion,
you're all dead.

76
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:47,480
Xu You'an took that opera singer
to the Jiang residence.

77
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:50,199
Jiang Chun'er is at the Governor Mansion.
We can't get to her.

78
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:55,439
If we can't do it openly, we go dark.

79
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:01,199
No matter what, Jiang Chun'er must die.

80
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:06,759
She mustn't become the chamber head.
It'd only secure the hold of Xu You'an.

81
00:08:06,839 --> 00:08:07,639
Yes.

82
00:08:16,879 --> 00:08:22,079
No cooperation, no way out.

83
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:26,279
Whether it's Jiang Chun'er or Xu You'an,

84
00:08:28,768 --> 00:08:31,456
anyone who stands in my way
to the Buddha Head and the phoenix crown

85
00:08:34,688 --> 00:08:35,840
must die.

86
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,519
I had people look into it.

87
00:09:09,679 --> 00:09:12,440
No one went in or out
around the time it happened.

88
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:15,679
That means the murderer
must be very familiar with this place.

89
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:31,519
I'd like to see who
dares to play tricks in front of me.

90
00:09:36,799 --> 00:09:38,464
The gun you stole
doesn't shoot straight.

91
00:09:38,639 --> 00:09:39,639
Use this one.

92
00:09:46,639 --> 00:09:47,440
Master,

93
00:09:47,679 --> 00:09:50,879
please don't come back
as an evil ghost to kill us.

94
00:09:50,879 --> 00:09:51,600
Yes,

95
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,879
every wrong has its owner.

96
00:09:52,879 --> 00:09:54,200
Just go find the young lady.

97
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,639
We are all innocent.

98
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,639
What are you doing here so late?

99
00:09:57,759 --> 00:10:00,399
We're afraid the master
will come back as an evil ghost.

100
00:10:00,399 --> 00:10:01,200
Nonsense.

101
00:10:01,559 --> 00:10:04,919
Since the master died,
rumors have been everywhere,

102
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:06,840
all saying the young lady murdered him.

103
00:10:07,039 --> 00:10:08,399
Some even say...

104
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:10,039
Even say...

105
00:10:10,039 --> 00:10:10,840
Say what?

106
00:10:11,399 --> 00:10:16,360
They say she was possessed.
That's why she killed her own father.

107
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:21,000
They say the master will return
as an evil ghost to kill us all.

108
00:10:24,159 --> 00:10:25,039
An evil ghost?

109
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,120
Killed her father?

110
00:10:26,519 --> 00:10:28,440
Talk of ghosts and spirits
is all nonsense.

111
00:10:29,039 --> 00:10:30,720
I will definitely catch the murderer

112
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:34,399
and make that "evil ghost"
vanish into ashes.

113
00:10:34,639 --> 00:10:38,840
You're serving the Jiang family. Don't
gossip about Miss Jiang like others do.

114
00:10:39,584 --> 00:10:41,000
Quickly put these things away.

115
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,240
- Yes.
- Yes.

116
00:10:42,559 --> 00:10:43,360
Let's go.

117
00:10:44,416 --> 00:10:46,639
I don't believe
we can't find a single clue.

118
00:10:52,159 --> 00:10:53,919
You can eliminate one evil ghost,

119
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:59,200
but can you kill all the people
with evil in their hearts in this world?

120
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,840
(Song Mianxiang, police coroner)
After all, the victim's death

121
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:09,919
exactly matches the serial murder case
that shook Fengcheng eight years ago.

122
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:18,919
Nice to meet you.

123
00:11:19,519 --> 00:11:20,639
Let me introduce myself.

124
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,159
I am...

125
00:11:23,264 --> 00:11:27,600
Coming alone to the crime scene?
That's not normal.

126
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:33,240
I am the coroner with the police,
Song Mianxiang.

127
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:36,480
(Coroner's Certificate)
My certificate.

128
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:44,879
Does this count
as meeting the hard way, Governor?

129
00:11:45,184 --> 00:11:46,016
(Song Mianxiang)

130
00:11:48,519 --> 00:11:51,279
As a coroner,
why are you here late at night?

131
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:54,279
(Coroner's Certificate)

132
00:11:54,279 --> 00:11:55,080
Who is this?

133
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:59,080
Just answer the question truthfully.

134
00:12:02,039 --> 00:12:04,279
When I examined the victim's body,

135
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:08,440
I found his limbs were all broken,
and the way he died was odd.

136
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:11,440
So I came here to find the answers.

137
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:18,720
I checked Fengcheng's files. It matches
the cases from eight years ago.

138
00:12:20,399 --> 00:12:24,080
It could be revenge or a copycat murder.

139
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:26,600
Why didn't you report your findings?

140
00:12:29,039 --> 00:12:33,960
Why exactly did you come alone
to the crime scene at this hour?

141
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:41,600
Of course, to solve the case quickly,
earn your recognition,

142
00:12:42,759 --> 00:12:44,559
and make sure you remember me.

143
00:12:54,048 --> 00:12:55,296
Let's go to the police station.

144
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:56,639
Let's go.

145
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:52,608
♪As if it were fate♪

146
00:13:52,608 --> 00:13:54,061
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

147
00:13:54,623 --> 00:13:57,860
♪We miss each other♪

148
00:13:59,104 --> 00:14:00,672
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

149
00:14:00,672 --> 00:14:03,072
♪And a bizarre♪

150
00:14:03,072 --> 00:14:05,874
♪Anonymous legend♪

151
00:14:06,404 --> 00:14:08,416
♪The plot twists and turns♪

152
00:14:08,564 --> 00:14:10,304
♪Play out over and over again♪

153
00:14:10,304 --> 00:14:13,368
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

154
00:14:13,504 --> 00:14:15,584
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

155
00:14:15,584 --> 00:14:16,576
♪Refuse to submit♪

156
00:14:16,576 --> 00:14:19,840
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

157
00:14:21,376 --> 00:14:24,224
♪There are always too many♪

158
00:14:24,224 --> 00:14:26,208
♪Helpless situations♪

159
00:14:26,208 --> 00:14:28,928
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

160
00:14:30,059 --> 00:14:32,019
♪Even if I have questions♪

161
00:14:32,019 --> 00:14:33,888
♪I harbor desires♪

162
00:14:33,888 --> 00:14:36,896
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

163
00:14:37,247 --> 00:14:38,784
♪People come and go♪

164
00:14:38,784 --> 00:14:41,696
♪I'm still all alone♪

165
00:14:41,696 --> 00:14:44,424
♪Wandering around♪

166
00:14:44,424 --> 00:14:47,525
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

167
00:14:47,525 --> 00:14:51,986
♪Go through the entanglement♪

168
00:14:52,256 --> 00:14:54,080
♪If longing♪

169
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:57,239
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

170
00:14:57,239 --> 00:14:59,994
♪How can I be at ease♪

171
00:15:00,096 --> 00:15:02,410
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

172
00:15:02,410 --> 00:15:04,384
♪And travelled around the world♪

173
00:15:04,384 --> 00:15:07,568
♪Scars all over me♪

174
00:15:07,568 --> 00:15:10,752
♪If longing never fades♪

175
00:15:10,752 --> 00:15:12,201
♪Burns still hot♪

176
00:15:12,201 --> 00:15:15,280
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

177
00:15:15,424 --> 00:15:17,409
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

178
00:15:17,409 --> 00:15:18,496
♪In the next life♪

179
00:15:18,496 --> 00:15:23,136
♪Entangle with you again♪
